        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>A Shared Propensity Towards Food &amp; Alcohol</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    background: #d8d8d8;\n    background-image:\n      linear-gradient(135deg, #cfcfcf 25%, transparent 25%),\n      linear-gradient(225deg, #cfcfcf 25%, transparent 25%),\n      linear-gradient(315deg, #cfcfcf 25%, transparent 25%),\n      linear-gradient(45deg, #cfcfcf 25%, transparent 25%);\n    background-size: 26px 26px;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .poster {\n    width: 1056px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 22px 40px 10px 40px;\n  }\n  h1.poster-title {\n    font-size: 41px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: 12px 0 26px 0;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    font-family: \"Arial Narrow\", Arial, sans-serif;\n  }\n  .columns {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 18px;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n  .col { flex: 1 1 0; }\n  .col.left { flex: 0 0 313px; }\n  .col.mid  { flex: 0 0 313px; }\n  .col.right{ flex: 0 0 313px; }\n\n  .band {\n    background: #111;\n    color: #fff;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 23px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    padding: 10px 8px;\n    font-family: \"Arial Narrow\", Arial, sans-serif;\n  }\n  .card {\n    background: #fff;\n    padding: 18px 18px 22px 18px;\n  }\n  .card p { font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 12px 0; }\n  .card ul { font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 6px 0 12px 0; padding-left: 22px; }\n  .card li { margin-bottom: 4px; }\n\n  /* stat rows */\n  .stat-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 12px;\n    margin: 14px 0;\n  }\n  .stat-num {\n    font-size: 40px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1;\n    min-width: 108px;\n    font-family: \"Arial Narrow\", Arial, sans-serif;\n  }\n  .stat-icon {\n    width: 44px;\n    height: 40px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #444;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 1.05;\n  }\n  .stat-text { font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.35; }\n\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #999;\n    color: #555;\n    font-size: 9.5px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 2px;\n    background: #fafafa;\n  }\n\n  .icon-strip {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 26px;\n    margin: 14px 0 18px 0;\n  }\n  .icon-strip .placeholder { width: 60px; height: 60px; }\n\n  /* results table */\n  table.results {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-size: 10.5px;\n  }\n  table.results th, table.results td {\n    border: 1px solid #333;\n    padding: 6px 7px;\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n  table.results thead th {\n    background: #b9b9b9;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n  table.results th.num, table.results td.num { text-align: left; width: 62px; }\n\n  /* bar chart */\n  .chart-title { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; margin: 20px 0 12px 0; }\n  .bar-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n    font-size: 10.5px;\n  }\n  .bar-label {\n    width: 58px;\n    text-align: right;\n    padding-right: 8px;\n    color: #222;\n  }\n  .axis-tick { width: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #333; }\n  .bar {\n    height: 15px;\n    border: 1px solid #111;\n  }\n  .bar.b13 { width: 92px;  background: #fff; }\n  .bar.b25 { width: 150px; background: #c9c9c9; }\n  .bar.b42 { width: 214px; background: #4d4d4d; }\n  .bar.b20 { width: 118px; background: #111; }\n  .bar-val { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; padding-left: 6px; }\n\n  .sub-h { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; margin: 16px 0 4px 0; }\n\n  /* conclusion */\n  .card.conclusion p { font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 16px; }\n  .card.conclusion b { font-weight: 700; }\n\n  /* footer */\n  .footer {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin-top: 24px;\n    padding: 6px 4px 14px 4px;\n  }\n  .footer-left {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 12px;\n  }\n  .footer-left .placeholder { width: 44px; height: 40px; }\n  .uni {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    line-height: 1.15;\n  }\n  .footer-right {\n    text-align: right;\n    font-size: 7.5px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    color: #222;\n    max-width: 620px;\n  }\n  .footer-right .strong { font-weight: 700; font-size: 8px; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"poster\">\n\n  <h1 class=\"poster-title\">A Shared Propensity Towards Food &amp; Alcohol</h1>\n\n  <div class=\"columns\">\n\n    <!-- LEFT COLUMN -->\n    <div class=\"col left\">\n      <div class=\"band\">Background</div>\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <p>Overeating and binge drinking are two of the most common health problems among college students:</p>\n\n        <div class=\"stat-row\">\n          <div class=\"stat-num\">48%</div>\n          <div class=\"stat-icon placeholder\">[Icon: burger]</div>\n          <div class=\"stat-text\">report binge<br>eating problems</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"stat-row\">\n          <div class=\"stat-num\">63%</div>\n          <div class=\"stat-icon placeholder\">[Icon: female symbol]</div>\n          <div class=\"stat-text\">of females report binge<br>drinking episodes</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"stat-row\">\n          <div class=\"stat-num\">85%</div>\n          <div class=\"stat-icon placeholder\">[Icon: male symbol]</div>\n          <div class=\"stat-text\">of males report binge<br>drinking episodes</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"band\" style=\"margin-top:14px;\">Alcohol is like food</div>\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon-strip\">\n          <div class=\"placeholder\">[Icon: wine glass]</div>\n          <div class=\"placeholder\">[Icon: fork &amp; knife plate]</div>\n          <div class=\"placeholder\">[Icon: beer glass]</div>\n        </div>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Alcohol is derived from sugar - similar chemical bases as food.</li>\n          <li>Both eating and drinking alcohol activate dopaminergic pathways in the human brain.</li>\n          <li>Addiction models have been applied to both food and alcohol use, as well as correlations between food and alcohol intake conducted in animal studies.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- MIDDLE COLUMN -->\n    <div class=\"col mid\">\n      <div class=\"band\">Method &amp; Measures</div>\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <p>200 UCLA Undergraduates (76% females, Mean Age - 22.1) filled out an online survey in one-sitting as part of a longer experimental study with the following exclusionary criteria:</p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Less than 21 years old</li>\n          <li>Self-reported history of eating disorders or substance abuse</li>\n          <li>Abstinence from drinking beer</li>\n          <li>A strict diet and food allergies to experimental stimuli</li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <div class=\"chart-title\"># of times alcohol was consumed with a meal / month:</div>\n\n        <div class=\"bar-row\">\n          <div class=\"bar-label\">Under 5</div><div class=\"axis-tick\"></div>\n          <div class=\"bar b13\"></div><div class=\"bar-val\">13%</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"bar-row\">\n          <div class=\"bar-label\">5-10</div><div class=\"axis-tick\"></div>\n          <div class=\"bar b25\"></div><div class=\"bar-val\">25%</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"bar-row\">\n          <div class=\"bar-label\">11-20</div><div class=\"axis-tick\"></div>\n          <div class=\"bar b42\"></div><div class=\"bar-val\">42%</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"bar-row\">\n          <div class=\"bar-label\">Over 20</div><div class=\"axis-tick\"></div>\n          <div class=\"bar b20\"></div><div class=\"bar-val\">20%</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"sub-h\">Alcohol Expectancy Questionnaire (AEQ)</div>\n        <p>A questionnaire measuring one's anticipatory effects of drinking and consuming alcohol.</p>\n\n        <div class=\"sub-h\">Dutch Eating Behavior Questionnaire (DEBQ)</div>\n        <p>A questionnaire assessing one's eating behaviors (since expectancies predict consumption, food expectancies are implicitly implied).</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- RIGHT COLUMN -->\n    <div class=\"col right\">\n      <div class=\"band\">Results</div>\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <table class=\"results\">\n          <thead>\n            <tr>\n              <th>AEQ / DEBQ</th>\n              <th class=\"num\">External</th>\n              <th class=\"num\">Emotional</th>\n            </tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td>Relaxation &amp; Tension Reduction</td><td class=\"num\">320</td><td class=\"num\">240</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Arousal &amp; Aggression</td><td class=\"num\">240</td><td class=\"num\">220</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Increased Social Assertiveness</td><td class=\"num\">250</td><td class=\"num\">169</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Physical &amp; Social Pleasure</td><td class=\"num\">210</td><td class=\"num\">114</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n\n        <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:100%; height:150px; margin-top:18px; border:none;\">\n          [Illustration: two facing head profiles, one with tangled scribble brain, one with storm cloud brain — centered]\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"band\" style=\"margin-top:14px;\">Conclusion</div>\n      <div class=\"card conclusion\">\n        <p><b>The results support our hypothesis that: Food expectancy is positively correlated to alcohol expectancy.</b></p>\n        <p>DEBQ External eating scale correlated to all AEQ scales, while DEBQ Emotional Eating scale only correlated to some AEQ scales.</p>\n        <p><b>External eating</b> had a more consistent relationship with alcohol expectancies, where <b>Emotional eating</b> had a less consistent relationship.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- FOOTER -->\n  <div class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"footer-left\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Logo: graduation cap]</div>\n      <div class=\"uni\">University of New York,<br>New York</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"footer-right\">\n      <div class=\"strong\">STUDY CONDUCTED BY: Carla Ramirez, Francis R. Griffon and Elena Takiyoma, UNIVERSITY OF NEW YORK</div>\n      RESOURCES: Walsh, Kathy; Chan, Anthony. \"The psychology of consumption and stress\" The Pearson Journal, 2017 &nbsp;//&nbsp; Saluda, Mariana; Temitope, Janet, \"Neuroscience of addiction and pleasure\"<br>\n      The Science Review, 2018. &nbsp;//&nbsp; Jurgen, Hans, Lee, Penelope, \"Consumption, Pleasure and Empowerment\", The Arch Journal, 2020.\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
